# One player, a circuit (gRace 3): the mode screen's fourth mode, the circuit screen (0x4000), then the track and
# car selects and a race with the drones (docs/port/SYNTH.md 2).
# until: 0x400000:600
# seconds: 90
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 1, windows 1, cars 6, mode 3, track 0
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen
15 DOWN 0.1    # the mode screen: three modes down
15.2 DOWN 0.1
15.4 DOWN 0.1
17 A           # the circuit
20 A           # the circuit screen (0x4000)
23 A           # the track select
26 A           # the car select
